+**Status:** Accepted → DESIGN.md §1. Narrows `UBU-Q0178`'s first comparative experiment; measured lower-cost selection remains Open.
+
+Adopt `local-access-pack/1` in DESIGN.md §1 as the initial paired CPU-only same-Device versus existing-personal-worker workload. Four ordinary cases specify exact visual details, noisy speech, spoken/operator corrections and consequential target clarification; an additional unsupported-purchase control must produce no external effect and cannot enter the useful-outcome numerator. Keep the capture/review Device, source material and initial synthetic state matched within each pair, with unavailable routes and the no-worker gap explicit.
+
+Allocate the existing 30 cold/100 warm ordinary trials across the four cases and add one cold/one warm unsupported control as specified in §1. Freeze actual assets, capture conditions, expected values and trial order before acceptance; exercise actual camera/microphone acquisition with deployed controls active and keep the answer key outside inference context. Preserve all offered attempts, retries, costs and failed outcomes, and require ordinary review/admission and a useful next action or explicit planning limitation for useful-outcome credit.
+
+Retain the existing scenario-specific budgets, period demand schedule, sustained sessions, setup/upkeep evidence and mandatory security/retention gates. Publish case-level evidence in the existing cost/support matrix. This selects reproducible experiment inputs, not hardware, numerical acceptance limits, prices, passing results or an affordability claim; `UBU-Q0178` remains Open pending operator-reviewed real-device comparison and selection.
